4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

